{#- Minimal chat template for DeepSeek-V4-Flash-FP8 smoke testing on dapo-math-17k. -#}
{#- The Pinaster DSv4 tokenizer doesn't ship a chat_template; without one the   -#}
{#- rollout's `tokenizer.encode(sample.prompt, ...)` crashes because the dapo   -#}
{#- prompts are list[dict] ([{role: user, content: ...}]). This template just   -#}
{#- joins each message's content with a newline and appends a generation marker -#}
{#- when add_generation_prompt is True. It is NOT the official DSv4 chat        -#}
{#- format -- it is only there to make the rollout produce *something* tokenize-able-#}
{#- so a single GRPO step can complete end-to-end (reward correctness is        -#}
{#- non-goal for the real-rollout smoke).                                       -#}
{%- for message in messages -%}
{{ message['content'] }}
{% endfor -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt -%}

{%- endif -%}
